Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.96,0:00:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请问现在为何都用小灯泡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let me ask you, Why is everybody using these tiny, little lights nowadays?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:09.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我记得以前都用大灯泡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I remember when people used big lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.26,0:00:11.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德爷爷话当年\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's a good story, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.84,0:00:15.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.59,0:00:19.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡让别人布置她的圣诞树\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow. Monica's letting other people help decorate her tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.85,0:00:22.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁又把她灌醉了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did someone get her drunk again, or...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.77,0:00:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞节的意义不在于圣诞树\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Having a perfectly decorated tree is not what Christmas is about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.19,0:00:28.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而在于  与所爱的人共度\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's about being with the people that you love.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.23,0:00:31.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真好  布置好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That is nice. And we're done. Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.86,0:00:37.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我总觉得它少了一股圣诞味\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I dunno what it is, It just doesn't quite feel like Christmas to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.83,0:00:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那这样呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.91,0:00:44.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样才像圣诞节\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See, now it feels like Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.96,0:00:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第六季  第10集  舞林高手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S06E10  The One With The Routinue
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.55,0:00:54.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.88,0:00:58.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.22,0:01:01.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.48,0:01:08.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.81,0:01:11.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.11,0:01:15.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.75,0:01:26.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（中央咖啡厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.50,0:01:28.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是犹太陀螺的由来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And that's the story of the dreidel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.13,0:01:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有些人说圣诞树源自古埃及\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, Some people trace the Christmas tree back to the Egyptians...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.22,0:01:39.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在每年白昼最短的日子  他们会把棕榈枝带进屋里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...who'd bring palm branches into huts on the shortest day of the year...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.18,0:01:42.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,象征生命战胜死亡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...symbolizing life's triumph over death.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.97,0:01:45.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是4千年前的事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And that was, like, 4000 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.14,0:01:49.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你开始讲古代  也差不多是那个时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, pretty much around the same time that you started telling this story.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.23,0:01:55.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家好  乔伊  怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you guys. Hey. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.61,0:01:59.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不出门不行啊  吉宁在房间到处拉筋折腾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I had to get out of the apartment. Janine's stretching all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.12,0:02:02.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随便一转头就看到她在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Everywhere I look she's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.41,0:02:09.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难怪你无法抗拒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can see why that's hard to resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.50,0:02:11.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我好喜欢她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I like her so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.71,0:02:13.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可惜她对你没感觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aw, I'm sorry sweetie that she doesn’t feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.75,0:02:15.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是啊  她好可爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know. And she's so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.71,0:02:19.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我好想喂她吃葡萄  帮她梳头\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just want to feed her grapes and brush her hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.43,0:02:23.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道她不是猴子吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are aware that she's not a monkey, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.68,0:02:28.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经对吉宁没感觉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am so over Janine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.40,0:02:34.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我原来觉得她火辣性感  但现在  没这回事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, Yeah, at first I thought she was hot, but now she's like old news.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.03,0:02:37.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们好  吉宁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, guys. Janine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.95,0:02:42.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚接到除夕特别节目的通告\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna be a dancer on a TV special for New Year's Eve.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.24,0:02:47.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫什么狄克摇滚狄奇之夜的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's called some sort of Dickin' Rockin' Dicky Eve.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.12,0:02:51.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,慢着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.04,0:02:55.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是《狄克克拉克新年摇滚之夜》吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you talking about Dick Clark's New Year's Rockin' Eve?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.75,0:02:57.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是我说的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, that's what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.18,0:03:03.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  我们爱死那个节目了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, we love that show!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.26,0:03:06.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从我有记忆以来  罗斯和我每年都看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross and I have been watching it since I can remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.52,0:03:09.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,内心深处的你还是个小胖妹  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah, you're still just a little fat girl inside, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.02,0:03:14.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我今年要去  我要当狂欢派对来宾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well I'm gonna be on it this year. I'm gonna be one of the party people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.98,0:03:19.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要去当派对来宾   那些人最酷了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're gonna be a party person? Those guys rock the most!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.11,0:03:23.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们叫我带人去  你愿意当我的舞伴吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well they said to bring someone. Do you wanna be my dance partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.74,0:03:26.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然了  我很愿意跟你跨年\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Totally! I would love to spend New Year's with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.70,0:03:29.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明天就要录影了  我也不太懂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well actually they're taping tomorrow. I don't understand why--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.71,0:03:31.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,流程是这样的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, how it works is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.37,0:03:35.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,时代广场的部分是现场直播\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...the part with Dick Clark in Times Square is actually live.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.42,0:03:38.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他们会预录狂欢派对的画面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But they tape some of the party stuff ahead of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.71,0:03:41.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道的人并不多\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, Not a lot of people know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.51,0:03:44.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们也想去吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you guys want to come too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.93,0:03:48.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的还假的  一言为定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you serious? We are there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.56,0:03:53.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你笑什么笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you laughing at?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.48,0:03:57.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟他交往过  但你还跟她在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I used to date him, but you're still going outwith her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.32,0:04:02.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  那我们就一起去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks. Great, so we can all go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.07,0:04:05.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得走了  回头见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I gotta run. catch you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.66,0:04:07.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见  吉宁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bye, Janine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.62,0:04:11.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是不是约我出去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did she just ask me out on a date?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.25,0:04:14.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,应该不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.83,0:04:18.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊  她找他参加的可是千禧年最盛大的晚会啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you talking about? She invited him to the biggest party of the millennium.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.42,0:04:20.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但她也找了你和罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, but she also invited you and Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.17,0:04:24.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉  那应该不算约会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, honey, I'm sorry, I don't think that that was a romantic thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.59,0:04:27.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许吧  但我有一个办法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, maybe. But, hey, I know how I can find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.76,0:04:29.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是要参加跨年晚会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're going to a New Year's Eve party, right? 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.72,0:04:34.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到了午夜  我可以亲她  要是她也回吻  漂亮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So at midnight, I can kiss her. And if she kisses me back, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.85,0:04:37.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是她说 "你干什么"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If she says, "Dude, what the hell are you doing?"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.44,0:04:40.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就说 "不是我  都是新年害的"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can say, "it wasn't me, it was New Year's."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.24,0:04:44.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比高中时罗斯想亲我要好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, that's a lot better than Ross kissing me in high school...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.16,0:04:48.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说他需要护唇膏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and saying that he did it because he needed Chap Stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.00,0:04:52.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那天很干燥\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was a dry day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.25,0:05:00.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要上《狄克克拉克新年摇滚之夜》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We are going to Dick Clark's New Year's Rockin' Eve!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.88,0:05:02.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.97,0:05:05.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.51,0:05:07.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.56,0:05:16.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我录过影\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I've been on sets before...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.85,0:05:18.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有些建议\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...so let me give you a little advice, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.77,0:05:22.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然只是上电视  我们只管跳舞  没什么大不了的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a show, but we're just dancing. It's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.40,0:05:25.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最重要的是  耍酷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Important thing to remember: Stay cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.65,0:05:27.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,了解  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Got it. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.91,0:05:30.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  跟我梦想的一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God! It's just like I dreamed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.99,0:05:33.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全体集合\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Everyone! Gather up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.16,0:05:36.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,借过  借过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Excuse us! Excuse us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.42,0:05:40.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的做法是  音乐一放  你们就跳舞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here's what's gonna happen.The music's gonna start, you're gonna dance...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.34,0:05:43.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会录影  你们不要看镜头  有问题吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...we'll tape it. Don't look at the camera. Any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.67,0:05:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有  什么时候播出\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, yeah, I have a question. Uh, when is this gonna air?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.80,0:05:51.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  你们去那边跳\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Now, uh, you guys dance over there...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.60,0:05:54.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们  去那边跳  你们两个在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you guys, over there. and I want you two right around here,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.60,0:05:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其他人散开  罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And everyone else, spread out. Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.60,0:06:00.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候播出\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So when is it gonna air?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.69,0:06:08.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你找厨房  我找后面的柜子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, you look in the kitchen, I will look in the back closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.24,0:06:11.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不必浪费时间了  我在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can save you time, ladies. I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.41,0:06:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  你出去一下  这件事与你无关\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Chandler why don't you take a walk? This doesn't concern you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.66,0:06:20.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在找摩妮卡送的圣诞礼物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're looking for our presents from Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.33,0:06:21.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  太差劲了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} What? That's terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.84,0:06:23.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会  我们每年都找\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No-no, we do it every year!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.71,0:06:26.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就不差劲了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, well, that makes it not terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.67,0:06:29.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们从来就没找到过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, yeah, we never find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.43,0:06:33.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她老是打败我们  奸诈的查某\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's always best at us that wily minx.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.14,0:06:36.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放心  我们找个l小时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't worry, we're just gonna search here for an hour..
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.35,0:06:39.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就会换到乔伊那边找  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and then we'll go to Joey's and search, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.31,0:06:42.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不好  你们不能找她送的礼物  我们一定要找\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No not okay, You can't look for Monica's presents.But we have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.86,0:06:46.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们不一定要找  也不能找  因为我也住在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, you don’t have to, And you can't, because I live here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.11,0:06:50.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你应该跟我们一起找\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, then you should look with us.
