Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.62,0:15:21.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你变态啊   给我滚出场\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's the matter with you?  Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.50,0:15:23.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,滚啦  失禁男\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, take a hike, wet pants!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.17,0:15:27.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你相信吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can you believe this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.71,0:15:29.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进入千禧年时我们会在平台上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're gonna be on the platform for the Millennium moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.88,0:15:30.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.72,0:15:34.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没有偷练招牌舞吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you haven't been practicing the routine, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.93,0:15:36.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.77,0:15:39.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.14,0:15:41.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回到现场时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When the music starts up again...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.81,0:15:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想跳机器人舞步\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I was thinking of maybe goind into the robot, y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.98,0:15:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  跳招牌舞就好  免得丢脸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross? We should stick to the routine. We don't want to look stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.87,0:15:56.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回到现场  倒数10秒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, we're back! Ten seconds left here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.74,0:16:00.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,10   9    8    7\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ten. Nine, eight, seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.12,0:16:03.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  这一刻终于来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, it all comes down to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.71,0:16:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切顺其自然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whatever happens, happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.21,0:16:09.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听天由命\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.26,0:16:12.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,3   2   1\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}three, two, one!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.55,0:16:14.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停  不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Cut! “No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.51,0:16:18.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Year!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.52,0:16:21.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新年不快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Happy No Year!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.69,0:16:26.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接着是时代广场的现场画面  大家辛苦了  收工\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, here's where we go to the live shot of Times Square,nice work everyone that's a wrap!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.37,0:16:40.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  看我找到什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, look who I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.79,0:16:42.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}On, hi, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.91,0:16:45.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乌类的方向感很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know, Birds have a very good sense of direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.58,0:16:48.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许他们可以帮忙找出礼物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and I thought maybe they could help us find where the presents are hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.55,0:16:53.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果礼物藏在南方过冬的话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, if the presents are hidden south for the winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.51,0:16:57.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,顺着你的笑话去找也行  你知道在哪里吗  当然不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Or we could just follow your clever jokes. Any ideas? Didn't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.47,0:17:01.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来  把礼物找出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, show us where the presents are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.23,0:17:05.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鸭子似乎认为摩妮卡送我垃圾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, the duck seems to think that Monica got me garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.44,0:17:09.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么样的回礼能跟垃圾一样好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wonder what I could get Monica that's as good as garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.40,0:17:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的AZ如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hmm. How about my “at”?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.36,0:17:20.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是空的  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. This is hollow. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.33,0:17:24.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这排座椅  是空心的  我居然都不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This bench, it's hollow. I can't believe I never knew that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.87,0:17:29.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的礼物  不要直视它们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, the presents! Don't look directly at them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.05,0:17:32.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.34,0:17:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事  不  可以看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, no, we could look at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.97,0:17:36.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This one's for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.63,0:17:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是钱德的  拿去  太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This one's for Chandler. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.14,0:17:42.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大包的是我的  赶快拆来看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And the big one's for me! Oh, let's open them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.89,0:17:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  我们不能这样  为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait a minute. We can't do this. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.31,0:17:50.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想知道摩妮卡送我什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't want to know what Monica got me.Y'know? I mean,look.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.82,0:17:54.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她一定很用心的替我找礼物  想给我惊喜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sure she worked hard at getting it and wanting to surprise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.78,0:17:56.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们这样会坏了情绪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you guys are gonna ruin that.and I,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.03,0:18:00.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得把礼物放回去  这样不叫圣诞节\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}look we have to put them back. this is not what Christmas is about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.83,0:18:03.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁理你  我要拆我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whatever, Linus. I'm opening mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.75,0:18:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁也不准拆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nobody is opening anything, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.29,0:18:14.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我想看摩妮卡  收到礼物的表情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want to see the look on Monica's face when I give her my present.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.26,0:18:17.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她一定也想看  我收到礼物的表情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sure she wants to see the look on my face when I get mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.01,0:18:21.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以求求你们放回去  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, please, please, can we just...? Can we put them back?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.81,0:18:25.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会送我们更好的礼物吗   好啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Will you get us better gifts? Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.60,0:18:28.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我回来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.15,0:18:32.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们找到礼物了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You found the presents?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.19,0:18:35.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  你让她们找到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler, you let them find the presents?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.28,0:18:36.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.49,0:18:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道那个滤水器多难找吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you know how long it took me to find you that water purifier?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.37,0:18:44.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你送我滤水器  这下我懂了  那种表情无价\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's what you got me? Yes, I see. That look is priceless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.58,0:18:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,甜蜜的家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Home sweet home, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.63,0:18:57.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回到现实真好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nice to, uh, get back to reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.43,0:19:02.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也知道新年会怎样了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Plus, we, uh, know how the New Year's gonna go off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.39,0:19:06.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,千禧虫也根本没什么  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I guess there's no reason for all that Y2K panic, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.73,0:19:10.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  晚安\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anyway, good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.35,0:19:12.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey? Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.57,0:19:16.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,3\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Three...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.40,0:19:19.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,2  1\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...two, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.95,0:19:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新年快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Happy New Year.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.21,0:19:34.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What was that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.25,0:19:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚当他们喊卡  我们没能接吻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tonight when they yelled "cut" and we didn't get to kiss...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.63,0:19:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很失望  我真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I was really, really disappointed, and I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.09,0:19:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的很想亲你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just really wanted to kiss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.56,0:19:46.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.43,0:19:52.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那时候  我也很想亲你  那时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In the moment, I really wanted to kiss you too. In the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.98,0:19:55.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那时候  只有那时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In the moment. But only in the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.48,0:20:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你  想再亲一次吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So do you, uh, want to kiss again?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.45,0:20:05.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想啊  离除夕只有两个星期\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure. New Year's Eve is only two weeks away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.95,0:20:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能等吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can you wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.45,0:20:08.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.75,0:20:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.08,0:20:17.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,3   2\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Three, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.17,0:20:20.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  不必每次接吻都倒数\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, you don't have to count down every time we kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.72,0:20:22.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.68,0:20:28.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我觉得  我需要几秒钟做准备\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Except I sort of felt like I needed a couple seconds to get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.41,0:20:55.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在平台上  准备带全世界跳进千禧年\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We were on the platform, ready to dance into the new millennium...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.13,0:20:58.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙却喊了卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and the guy yells "cut!"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.92,0:21:02.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你们真的跳了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you guys are telling me that you actually did...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.09,0:21:05.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,八年级的招牌舞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...the routine from eighth grade?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.01,0:21:09.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  不过当然得稍做修正\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah! But of course we had to update it a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.85,0:21:12.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你反应真快  知道要接住我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, by the way, quick thinking about catching me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.06,0:21:16.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我正想说  你们绝不可能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}‘Cos I was gonna say there's no way you could've done the end...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.94,0:21:19.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,照以前的结尾跳\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...the way you guys did it back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.28,0:21:23.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  当然可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? We could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.03,0:21:28.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行吧  你以前胖的 壮的多了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know. You were a lot bigger-I mean, stronger back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.91,0:21:32.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can do it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.00,0:21:35.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧  我们来试\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, let's go! Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.58,0:21:38.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,l    2    3    4\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}One, two, three, four...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.96,0:21:41.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,5    6    7    8\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...five, six, seven, eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.34,0:21:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不行了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't do it! Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.17,0:21:48.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那样跳  就能上电视了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, you do that, you're on TV.
